# Licensing notice

This repository is a mixed-license scientific software collection. No single
blanket license applies to every file.

- Roman-authored paths explicitly identified as MIT in
  `provenance/LICENSE_MATRIX.csv` and `provenance/ROMAN_MIT_PATHS.txt` are
  offered under the MIT License. Unrecognized paths are not presumed MIT.
- The source-faithful Bryson-derived likelihood and measurement-error files are
  distributed under GNU GPL version 2 only, conservatively preserving the
  upstream terms.
- Daniel Huber's verbatim PARSEC-TAMS table remains under Daniel Huber's MIT
  License.
- Fetched dependencies and scientific inputs remain under their upstream
  licenses and are not relicensed here.

The authoritative path-level assignments are in
`provenance/LICENSE_MATRIX.csv`. Full license texts and detailed redistribution
rules are in `LICENSES/` and `LICENSE_POLICY.md`.
